You're right that once the decicion that there is no portal to Ludios is 
done there is no way to create one, but you're wrong on when the 
decicion is done.

Ludios portal is not created on startup but when a particular level is 
created. Everytime a vault is created a function mk_knox_portal(9 is 
called and that function decides if the portal is put in or not.

There is 2/3 chance that the portal is created on level that is in the 
main dungeon, is lower than 10th level, doesn't have the quest portal, 
is higher than the Medusa level and has a vault. Of course once it's 
created it's not created again.

